            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko ntungiriye igitsure iki gisagara ngo nkizanekw amagorwa, sinkizanekw amahirwe, ni jewe Uhoraho mbivuze; kizotangwa mu kuboko kw’umwami w’i Babuloni, kand’ azogitongoza umuriro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
